 night. The aim of the game is to get filthy rich! And avoid homelessness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use some awesome tools like; a bag of marbles? A magnifying glass? Or a rock? Why does that cost so much?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161950/extras/LadderShowcase.gif?t=1740426668\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161950/extras/solve_puzzles.png?t=1740426668\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore the graveyards, keep an eye out for keys lying around. Hopefully, they'll unlock the high rise part of the graveyard? Or perhaps the dungeons? <strong>[Coming Soon]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161950/extras/DiggingUI.gif?t=1740426668\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161950/extras/scottish_inspired.png?t=1740426668\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by Burke &amp; Hare, you'll go into a graveyard inspired from 1800's Edinburgh, with the sole intention of robbing graves either alone or with a friend. See how many Scottish easter eggs you can find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161950/extras/Cinematic.gif?t=1740426668\" /></p>","developers":["Afterfire Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161950/header.jpg?t=1740426668","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101441,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101441/movie480.mp4?t=1740347161","max":"http://video.akamai